{
  "id": "s4-notice",
  "title": "不是討論",
  "lines": [
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "我說完了。雨澄看著我，沒有低頭看資料夾。我等她開口。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "direct" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "好。繼續。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "direct" }] },

    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雨澄低頭看了一眼自己的 T 恤。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "MAKE IT OBVIOUS。你說的是「影響」，文件寫的是「裁撤」。我們先選一個名詞。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },
    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "文件上的名詞比較接近事實。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "公司決定裁撤你目前的職位。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },

    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "這是績效改善計畫？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "不是，我只是想先把背景——", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "我需要更正。這次決定不是績效處分，也沒有核准用個人表現作為理由。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雨澄把原子筆從掛繩上取下，平放在桌上。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "那你剛才是在幫公司找理由，還是在幫自己找？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "我看了一眼雅琳的平板，沒接話。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },

    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "資料夾攤在我們中間，封面上是雨澄的名字。", "background": "cg-rights-packet" },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "主要客戶解約後，公司取消了你負責的產品線，也決定不把這個職位轉到其他團隊。", "background": "moon-meeting-room-rain" },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "日期、給付、保險、設備處理和聯絡窗口，都列在文件裡。", "background": "moon-meeting-room-rain" },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "「決定」。" },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "她重複了一次，抬頭看我。" },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "所以你們不是來問我的。這不是討論，只是通知？" }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "answer-admit",
      "text": "「對，公司已經決定了。抱歉，現在才告訴你。」",
